{"seq":2,"slug":"postpurchase-event-bus-state-machine","title":"购后事件总线与旅程状态机编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/postpurchase-journey-model/postpurchase-event-bus-state-machine","wordCount":3396,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"购后事件总线与旅程状态机编排\">购后事件总线与旅程状态机编排</h1><p>订单支付成功那一刻，系统的注意力就从&quot;成交&quot;转向了&quot;交付与关系&quot;。但从支付成功到用户复购之间，横跨着支付、仓储、承运商、清关、末端派送、评价、客服等多个彼此独立、且大量依赖第三方回调的子系统。这些系统之间没有共享事务，也没有统一时钟——承运商的 <code>Delivered</code> 事件可能比它自己的 <code>InTransit</code> 晚到几小时甚至几天，用户可能在收到货前就点了评价。把这段旅程做成可运营、可实验、可追溯的能力，核心是两件事：一条<strong>承载不可变事实的事件总线</strong>，和一台<strong>把事实演绎成&quot;用户此刻在哪一步&quot;的旅程状态机</strong>。本文讨论这两者的建模、契约与工程约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-事实层-状态层与编排层\">核心概念：事实层、状态层与编排层</h2><p>购后系统里最容易混淆的是三个概念，必须先把它们拆开。</p>\n<p><strong>事件（Event）</strong> 是已经发生且不可变的事实，例如 <code>ParcelScanned</code>、<code>Delivered</code>、<code>ReviewSubmitted</code>。它只有追加、没有更新，一旦写入就不允许修改语义。<strong>状态（State）</strong> 是从事件流投影出来的当前结论，例如&quot;订单 A 当前处于 <code>OUT_FOR_DELIVERY</code>&quot;。状态是可重建的派生数据——删掉状态库，重放事件流应当能算出同样的结果。<strong>命令（Command）</strong> 是意图，例如 <code>SendDeliveryNudge</code>，它可以被拒绝、可以重试，因此它不是事实。</p>\n<p>三者构成三层职责：总线负责事实的<strong>投递与持久化</strong>，状态机负责事实到结论的<strong>投影与守卫</strong>，编排器负责结论到动作的<strong>决策与执行</strong>。把它们混在一张表里（常见做法是用一张 <code>order_status</code> 表同时承载事实、状态和待发消息）会在遇到乱序、重放、多渠道触达时全面失效。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[支付成功 OrderPaid] --&gt; B[事件总线&lt;br/&gt;不可变事实流]&#10;  C[承运商回调&lt;br/&gt;ParcelScanned / Delivered] --&gt; B&#10;  D[用户行为&lt;br/&gt;PushOpened / ReviewSubmitted] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; E[旅程状态机&lt;br/&gt;State Projection]&#10;  E --&gt; F[旅程快照&lt;br/&gt;Journey Snapshot]&#10;  E --&gt; G[触达编排器&lt;br/&gt;Orchestrator]&#10;  G --&gt; H[推送 / 短信 / 邮件 / IM]&#10;  H --&gt; D&#10;  F --&gt; I[分析与实验平台]&#10;  E --&gt; J[死信队列 DLQ]\">graph TD\n  A[支付成功 OrderPaid] --&gt; B[事件总线&lt;br/&gt;不可变事实流]\n  C[承运商回调&lt;br/&gt;ParcelScanned / Delivered] --&gt; B\n  D[用户行为&lt;br/&gt;PushOpened / ReviewSubmitted] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; E[旅程状态机&lt;br/&gt;State Projection]\n  E --&gt; F[旅程快照&lt;br/&gt;Journey Snapshot]\n  E --&gt; G[触达编排器&lt;br/&gt;Orchestrator]\n  G --&gt; H[推送 / 短信 / 邮件 / IM]\n  H --&gt; D\n  F --&gt; I[分析与实验平台]\n  E --&gt; J[死信队列 DLQ]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>事件总线</th>\n<th>旅程状态机</th>\n<th>触达编排器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据性质</td>\n<td>不可变事实，只追加</td>\n<td>可变派生结论</td>\n<td>待执行意图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要职责</td>\n<td>投递、持久化、重放</td>\n<td>投影、守卫、去重</td>\n<td>决策、调度、执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幂等要求</td>\n<td>去重靠 event_id</td>\n<td>转换幂等 + 版本比较</td>\n<td>发送幂等（dedup key）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败处理</td>\n<td>重投、DLQ</td>\n<td>丢弃过期/非法转换</td>\n<td>重试、退避、熔断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可重建性</td>\n<td>是唯一真相源</td>\n<td>可由总线重放重建</td>\n<td>不可重建，需审计日志</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判断边界是否划对了，有一个简单检验：<strong>若删掉状态库，只保留事件流和状态机的转换规则，系统能否恢复到一致状态？</strong> 答案若否定，说明业务逻辑被写进了状态表而非转换规则里，这是后续无法重放、无法做实验的根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"购后事件的分类与-schema-契约\">购后事件的分类与 Schema 契约</h2><p>跨组织的购后事件必须有显式契约，否则支付域、履约域、营销域会各自发明字段名，最终靠字符串拼接做关联。成熟做法是采用 <strong>CNCF CloudEvents 1.0</strong> 作为事件信封，把领域负载放在 <code>data</code> 字段里。CloudEvents 规定了 <code>id</code>、<code>source</code>、<code>type</code>、<code>specversion</code>、<code>time</code> 等必填属性，其中 <code>id</code> + <code>source</code> 的组合天然构成全局去重键。</p>\n<p>对于物理履约事件，更专业的做法是对齐 <strong>GS1 EPCIS 2.0</strong>（GS1 批准的标准）。EPCIS 定义了 <code>ObjectEvent</code>、<code>AggregationEvent</code>、<code>TransformationEvent</code>、<code>AssociationEvent</code> 四类事件模型，并要求用 GS1 标识（GTIN 标识商品、SSCC 标识物流单元）引用对象。跨境场景中包裹在承运商、海外仓、清关行之间流转，用 SSCC 而非平台内部订单号做关联，才能在头程与尾程换单时保持链路不断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件域</th>\n<th>代表事件</th>\n<th>主要来源</th>\n<th>关联键</th>\n<th>时效敏感度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易域</td>\n<td><code>OrderPaid</code>、<code>OrderCancelled</code>、<code>RefundIssued</code></td>\n<td>订单/支付中心</td>\n<td>order_id</td>\n<td>高（秒级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约域</td>\n<td><code>ShipmentDispatched</code>、<code>ParcelScanned</code>、<code>Delivered</code></td>\n<td>承运商回调 / WMS</td>\n<td>SSCC + order_id</td>\n<td>中（分钟级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常域</td>\n<td><code>DeliveryAttemptFailed</code>、<code>CustomsHeld</code></td>\n<td>承运商 / 清关行</td>\n<td>SSCC</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互动域</td>\n<td><code>PushOpened</code>、<code>ReviewSubmitted</code>、<code>OnboardingCompleted</code></td>\n<td>客户端 / 评价服务</td>\n<td>user_id + order_id</td>\n<td>低（小时级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复购域</td>\n<td><code>RepurchaseWindowOpened</code>、<code>SubscriptionRenewed</code></td>\n<td>营销 / 订阅服务</td>\n<td>user_id</td>\n<td>低（天级）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个符合 CloudEvents 的履约事件大致如下，注意 <code>time</code> 是<strong>事实发生时间</strong>（event time）而非投递时间；两者混用会让延迟指标与乱序判断全部失真。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;specversion&quot;: &quot;1.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;b7c9f1e2-4a3d-4f8a-9c21-0d5e6a7b8c90&quot;,&#10;  &quot;source&quot;: &quot;/carriers/dhl-express&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;com.gs1.epcis.ObjectEvent.Delivered&quot;,&#10;  &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-03-14T09:21:07Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;subject&quot;: &quot;SSCC:340123450000001234&quot;,&#10;  &quot;datacontenttype&quot;: &quot;application/json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;1024-8801-A&quot;,&#10;    &quot;attempt_no&quot;: 1,&#10;    &quot;location_gln&quot;: &quot;4012345000019&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"specversion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"b7c9f1e2-4a3d-4f8a-9c21-0d5e6a7b8c90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/carriers/dhl-express\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.gs1.epcis.ObjectEvent.Delivered\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"time\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-03-14T09:21:07Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"subject\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SSCC:340123450000001234\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"datacontenttype\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1024-8801-A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"attempt_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"location_gln\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4012345000019\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>契约演进必须向后兼容：新增字段安全，删除或改变字段语义是破坏性的。破坏性变更需发布新的事件 <code>type</code> 版本（如 <code>...Delivered.v2</code>），而非原地修改。跨组织场景下这条纪律尤其重要，因为承运商不可能与平台同步升级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"旅程状态机的建模与幂等转换\">旅程状态机的建模与幂等转换</h2><p>旅程状态机可以形式化为一个五元组：状态集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、事件集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>、转换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta: S \\times E \\to S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、初始状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>PAID</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_0 = \\text{PAID}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PAID</span></span></span></span></span></span>、以及终态集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>若 </mtext><mi>e</mi><mtext> 在 </mtext><mi>s</mi><mtext> 的合法后继中</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>s</mi></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>若 </mtext><mi>e</mi><mtext> 与 </mtext><mi>s</mi><mtext> 无关（忽略）</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>DLQ</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>若 </mtext><mi>e</mi><mtext> 违反不变量</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta(s, e) = \\begin{cases} s&#x27; &amp; \\text{若 } e \\text{ 在 } s \\text{ 的合法后继中} \\\\ s &amp; \\text{若 } e \\text{ 与 } s \\text{ 无关（忽略）} \\\\ \\text{DLQ} &amp; \\text{若 } e \\text{ 违反不变量} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DLQ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">若</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的合法后继中</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">若</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">与</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">无关（忽略）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">若</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">违反不变量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在于第三行。<strong>乱序到达的过期事件必须被识别并忽略，而不是当作错误或强行回退状态。</strong> 若用户在包裹显示&quot;已签收&quot;后收到一条延迟的 <code>InTransit</code>，正确的处理是保持 <code>DELIVERED</code>，而不是把状态改回 <code>IN_TRANSIT</code>——因为从用户视角看，事实是已经收到了货。实现上通常给每次转换附加单调递增的版本号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>seq</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{seq}(e) &gt; v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">seq</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 时才接受转换；对时间维度则用 event time 的水位线（watermark）判断迟到：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>lag</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>event_time</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>若 lag</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>W</mi><mtext> 则标记为迟到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{lag}(e) = t_{\\text{now}} - t_{\\text{event\\_time}}(e), \\quad \\text{若 } \\text{lag} &gt; W \\text{ 则标记为迟到}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lag</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">event_time</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">若</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lag</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">则标记为迟到</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是允许的迟到窗口（履约域通常设为数小时，互动域可设为数天）。迟到事件仍然入库（事实不可丢），但不参与状态推进。</p>\n<p>主链路的转换规则如下表，注意大量分支来自&quot;异常&quot;而非&quot;正常&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>起始状态</th>\n<th>触发事件</th>\n<th>目标状态</th>\n<th>守卫条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PAID</td>\n<td><code>ShipmentDispatched</code></td>\n<td>SHIPPED</td>\n<td>存在有效履约单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SHIPPED</td>\n<td><code>ParcelScanned</code></td>\n<td>IN_TRANSIT</td>\n<td>扫描节点非起点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IN_TRANSIT</td>\n<td><code>OutForDelivery</code></td>\n<td>OUT_FOR_DELIVERY</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OUT_FOR_DELIVERY</td>\n<td><code>Delivered</code></td>\n<td>DELIVERED</td>\n<td>签收记录存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OUT_FOR_DELIVERY</td>\n<td><code>DeliveryAttemptFailed</code></td>\n<td>DELIVERY_FAILED</td>\n<td>尝试次数 &lt; 上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DELIVERY_FAILED</td>\n<td><code>ShipmentDispatched</code></td>\n<td>OUT_FOR_DELIVERY</td>\n<td>重新派送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DELIVERED</td>\n<td><code>OnboardingCompleted</code></td>\n<td>ONBOARDED</td>\n<td>品类需要安装引导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DELIVERED</td>\n<td><code>ReturnStarted</code></td>\n<td>RETURNING</td>\n<td>在退货窗口内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RETURNING</td>\n<td><code>RefundIssued</code></td>\n<td>REFUNDED</td>\n<td>退款金额校验通过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任意非终态</td>\n<td><code>OrderCancelled</code></td>\n<td>CANCELLED</td>\n<td>未进入 DELIVERED</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>状态机的实现必须满足<strong>转换幂等</strong>：同一事件重复消费（at-least-once 投递下必然发生）不能产生副作用叠加。落地方式是给每次状态写入带上 <code>event_id</code> 去重键，并在同一事务内校验期望的原状态（乐观并发）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE journey_state&#10;   SET state = :next_state,&#10;       version = version + 1,&#10;       last_event_id = :event_id,&#10;       updated_at = now()&#10; WHERE order_id = :order_id&#10;   AND version = :expected_version&#10;   AND last_event_id IS DISTINCT FROM :event_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journey_state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :next_state,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       last_event_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :event_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :expected_version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_event_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :event_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>若更新影响 0 行，说明要么事件已处理过（去重命中），要么有并发写入（需重读当前状态再判断转换是否仍合法）。两者处理不同，日志里必须区分，否则去重逻辑会掩盖真实的并发冲突。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件总线的投递语义与技术选型\">事件总线的投递语义与技术选型</h2><p>总线的选型取决于三个硬约束：<strong>单订单有序</strong>、<strong>可重放</strong>、<strong>投递语义</strong>。单订单有序用分区键实现——以 <code>order_id</code>（或 <code>SSCC</code>）为键，保证同一订单的事件按序消费；保留期至少覆盖最长旅程（退货窗口可能长达 30 天以上）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>有序性</th>\n<th>投递语义</th>\n<th>保留/重放</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Apache Kafka</td>\n<td>分区内有序</td>\n<td>at-least-once；幂等生产者 + 事务可 EOS</td>\n<td>按时间/大小保留，可 reset offset 重放</td>\n<td>高吞吐、需重放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache Pulsar</td>\n<td>分区内有序</td>\n<td>at-least-once / EOS</td>\n<td>分层存储，保留期长</td>\n<td>多租户、长保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS EventBridge</td>\n<td>无全局有序</td>\n<td>at-least-once</td>\n<td>归档后可 replay</td>\n<td>云原生事件路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NATS JetStream</td>\n<td>流内有序</td>\n<td>at-least-once / EOS</td>\n<td>按流保留，可重放</td>\n<td>低延迟轻量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型上的常见误区是<strong>迷信 exactly-once</strong>。EOS 只在&quot;消费—处理—再产出&quot;都落在同一事务边界内时才成立。当状态机需要写入外部数据库（如 PostgreSQL 中的 <code>journey_state</code>）时，跨系统事务不可行，正确做法是<strong>at-least-once + 幂等消费者</strong>，再叠加**事务性发件箱（Transactional Outbox）**保证&quot;数据库写入&quot;与&quot;事件发布&quot;的原子性——把待发事件写进与业务表同库的 outbox 表，再由 CDC（如 Debezium）或轮询发布器投递到总线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[业务事务&lt;br/&gt;写 journey_state] --&gt; B[(同库 outbox 表)]&#10;  B --&gt; C[CDC / 轮询发布器]&#10;  C --&gt; D[事件总线]&#10;  D --&gt; E[下游消费者]&#10;  E --&gt; F[幂等去重&lt;br/&gt;按 event_id]&#10;  F --&gt; G[状态转换]&#10;  G --&gt;|失败超限| H[DLQ]\">graph LR\n  A[业务事务&lt;br/&gt;写 journey_state] --&gt; B[(同库 outbox 表)]\n  B --&gt; C[CDC / 轮询发布器]\n  C --&gt; D[事件总线]\n  D --&gt; E[下游消费者]\n  E --&gt; F[幂等去重&lt;br/&gt;按 event_id]\n  F --&gt; G[状态转换]\n  G --&gt;|失败超限| H[DLQ]</pre><p>outbox 模式解决了&quot;先写库还是先发消息&quot;的二选一：把两个动作放进同一个本地事务，发布变成事务成功后的确定性副作用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"saga-编排与补偿-退货-取消与换货\">Saga 编排与补偿：退货、取消与换货</h2><p>购后旅程天然是一个长事务：它跨支付、履约、营销多个服务，且持续时间以天计，不可能用分布式事务锁住资源。这正是 <strong>Saga 模式</strong> 的适用场景（该模式由 Garcia-Molina 与 Salem 于 1987 年提出，用于长活事务的补偿）。Saga 有两种实现风格：<strong>编排式（Orchestration）</strong> 由中心编排器按剧本调用各服务并触发补偿；<strong>协同式（Choreography）</strong> 由各服务监听事件自行决定下一步。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>编排式</th>\n<th>协同式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流程可见性</td>\n<td>集中在编排器，易审计</td>\n<td>分散在各方，难以全局追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>耦合度</td>\n<td>服务只依赖编排器</td>\n<td>服务互相依赖事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合的流程复杂度</td>\n<td>高（多分支、多补偿）</td>\n<td>低（线性、步骤少）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更影响面</td>\n<td>改一处</td>\n<td>需协调多个服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型实现</td>\n<td>Temporal、Camunda、AWS Step Functions</td>\n<td>各服务订阅同一总线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境购后旅程的分支复杂度高（取消、部分退款、退货、换货、清关失败重派、丢失理赔），更适合编排式，典型实现有 Temporal、Camunda 与 AWS Step Functions。Temporal 的工作流历史本身就是事件溯源的——状态由历史事件重放得出，与本文的状态机思路同构。</p>\n<p>补偿的关键认知是：<strong>已发生的对外动作不可撤销，只能发布更正。</strong> 已发出的&quot;包裹已寄出&quot;无法收回，能做的是补发更正通知并记录反转。因此补偿不是&quot;回滚&quot;，而是&quot;追加反向事件&quot;——对状态机就是一条正常转换（如 <code>RETURNING → REFUNDED</code>），对下游的语义是&quot;撤销此前基于 <code>DELIVERED</code> 的假设&quot;。</p>\n<p>一次&quot;发货后取消&quot;的补偿序列是：<code>OrderCancelled</code> 触发拦截 → 履约侧确认拦截（失败则转退货）→ 支付侧退款 → 营销侧撤销该订单的触达计划。每一段都需要幂等键与重试策略，且必须能从中断处恢复，因此编排器每一步都要持久化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性-死信处理与-schema-演进\">可观测性、死信处理与 Schema 演进</h2><p>购后旅程的故障往往不是&quot;报错&quot;，而是&quot;静默卡住&quot;：订单停在 <code>SHIPPED</code> 再没进入 <code>IN_TRANSIT</code>，用户从没收到派送通知，而系统一切&quot;正常&quot;。因此可观测性的核心是把<strong>卡滞</strong>变成指标。每个事件应透传 W3C Trace Context 的 <code>traceparent</code>，配合 OpenTelemetry 实现跨服务追踪。建议至少监控以下 SLI：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>健康信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件端到端延迟</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>state_written</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>event_time</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{state\\_written}} - t_{\\text{event\\_time}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">state_written</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">event_time</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 p99</td>\n<td>履约域分钟级、互动域小时级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡滞旅程数</td>\n<td>停留某非终态超阈值的订单数</td>\n<td>按状态分桶，突增即告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DLQ 深度</td>\n<td>死信队列未处理条数</td>\n<td>稳定低水位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重放耗时</td>\n<td>全量重放重建状态的时间</td>\n<td>决定灾难恢复 RTO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema 拒绝率</td>\n<td>反序列化失败占比</td>\n<td>突增说明上游破坏性变更</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>死信队列不是垃圾桶，而是待分类的工单。</strong> 进入 DLQ 的事件分三类：格式非法（需上游修）、语义非法（如 <code>Delivered</code> 出现在 <code>PAID</code> 状态，可能是串单）、不可恢复的业务异常。第一类修 Schema 后重放，第二类人工核查，第三类可丢弃但须留审计记录。重放时必须复用原有 <code>event_id</code> 让幂等去重生效，否则重放本身会造成重复触达。</p>\n<p>Schema 演进遵循&quot;只加不改&quot;：新增可选字段安全，改字段类型或含义需要新的 <code>type</code> 版本。迁移期应同时兼容新旧两版反序列化器，等旧版事件保留期结束后再移除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>购后旅程的工程本质是&quot;<strong>不可变事件流 + 可重建状态投影 + 意图编排</strong>&quot;三层分离，把三者塞进一张状态表会导致乱序、重放、多渠道触达全面失效。</li>\n<li>事件契约优先采用 CNCF CloudEvents 1.0 作信封、领域负载放 <code>data</code>；物理履约事件对齐 GS1 EPCIS 2.0，用 GTIN/SSCC 做跨承运商关联键。</li>\n<li>状态机必须把&quot;<strong>乱序过期事件</strong>&quot;识别为应忽略的正常输入而非错误，用版本号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>seq</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{seq}(e) &gt; v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">seq</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 与 event time 水位线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 双重过滤。</li>\n<li>投递语义的现实选择是 <strong>at-least-once + 幂等消费者 + 事务性发件箱</strong>；exactly-once 在跨数据库边界时不可得，不应作为设计前提。</li>\n<li>补偿不是回滚——已发出的通知无法收回，补偿等于追加反向事件并撤销下游假设；分支复杂的旅程用编排式 Saga（Temporal / Step Functions）更易审计。</li>\n<li>可观测性重点在把&quot;卡滞&quot;变成指标，DLQ 需分类处理且重放必须复用 <code>event_id</code>，否则重放会造成重复触达。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节属于购后旅程模型的建模层，后续章节会在此状态机之上展开具体的追踪互动、安装引导与复购触达策略；本节的转换规则即为它们的共同基座。章节导航见 <a href=\"./\">本章索引</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"购后事件总线与旅程状态机编排","id":"购后事件总线与旅程状态机编排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：事实层、状态层与编排层","id":"核心概念-事实层-状态层与编排层"},{"level":2,"text":"购后事件的分类与 Schema 契约","id":"购后事件的分类与-schema-契约"},{"level":2,"text":"旅程状态机的建模与幂等转换","id":"旅程状态机的建模与幂等转换"},{"level":2,"text":"事件总线的投递语义与技术选型","id":"事件总线的投递语义与技术选型"},{"level":2,"text":"Saga 编排与补偿：退货、取消与换货","id":"saga-编排与补偿-退货-取消与换货"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性、死信处理与 Schema 演进","id":"可观测性-死信处理与-schema-演进"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"购后旅程阶段划分与关键触点建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/postpurchase-journey-model/postpurchase-journey-stage-touchpoint"},"next":{"title":"购后旅程身份归一与统一用户视图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/postpurchase-journey-model/journey-identity-resolution-profile"}}